    "Preterite: spelling change z→c before é (empecé), NO stem change",
    "Imperfect: regular -AR pattern, NO stem change",
    "Often used with \"a\" + infinitive: *empezar a trabajar* (to start working)",
    "Synonym: **comenzar** (same conjugation pattern)"
